From 4e87ae6dccf7f72d076a348787d4494ea5bdfa17 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The browser Authors <noreply@browser.invalid>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 17:12:37 -0500
Subject: [PATCH 15/55] frame-stream

Page.startFrameStream, updateFrameStream and stopFrameStream: uncompressed
frames of the page written to named shared memory, one event signalled per
frame, for a viewer that draws the page live. Windows only. The handler
wiring rides in agent-snapshot (page_handler.*, Page.pdl).
---
